{"seq":1,"slug":"retrieval-augmented-generation","title":"检索增强生成：让模型接入外部知识","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/nlp-transformers/applications/retrieval-augmented-generation","wordCount":1187,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"检索增强生成-让模型接入外部知识\">检索增强生成：让模型接入外部知识</h1><p>检索增强生成（Retrieval-Augmented Generation, RAG）将 Transformer 的生成能力与外部知识检索结合，解决大语言模型的三大痛点：知识时效性（训练数据截止后的新信息）、幻觉（自信地生成错误事实）、领域深度（企业私有知识库的覆盖）。2026 年，RAG 已从研究概念演变为生产系统的标准架构模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>RAG 的基本流程是：给定用户查询，先从外部知识库中检索相关文档片段，再将检索结果注入生成模型的上下文中，让模型基于检索到的证据进行回答。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    Q[用户查询] --&gt; ENCODE[查询编码器]&#10;    ENCODE --&gt; RETRIEVE[向量检索]&#10;    KB[(知识库/文档)] --&gt; INDEX[离线索引]&#10;    INDEX --&gt; RETRIEVE&#10;    RETRIEVE --&gt; CHUNKS[Top-K 相关片段]&#10;    CHUNKS --&gt; PROMPT[构造 Prompt]&#10;    Q --&gt; PROMPT&#10;    PROMPT --&gt; LLM[生成模型]&#10;    LLM --&gt; ANS[生成回答]\">graph LR\n    Q[用户查询] --&gt; ENCODE[查询编码器]\n    ENCODE --&gt; RETRIEVE[向量检索]\n    KB[(知识库/文档)] --&gt; INDEX[离线索引]\n    INDEX --&gt; RETRIEVE\n    RETRIEVE --&gt; CHUNKS[Top-K 相关片段]\n    CHUNKS --&gt; PROMPT[构造 Prompt]\n    Q --&gt; PROMPT\n    PROMPT --&gt; LLM[生成模型]\n    LLM --&gt; ANS[生成回答]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>关键技术</th>\n<th>2026 年主流选择</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>文档处理</td>\n<td>分块、结构化解析</td>\n<td>语义分块 + 层级分块混合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>向量化</td>\n<td>嵌入模型</td>\n<td>BGE-M3, E5-Mistral, GTE-Qwen2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>索引</td>\n<td>向量数据库</td>\n<td>Milvus, Qdrant, Pinecone</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检索</td>\n<td>相似度搜索 + 重排序</td>\n<td>向量召回 + Cross-Encoder 重排</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生成</td>\n<td>条件生成</td>\n<td>Llama 3, GPT-4o, Claude 4</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"检索器设计-从稀疏到稠密再到混合\">检索器设计：从稀疏到稠密再到混合</h2><p><strong>稀疏检索（BM25）</strong>：基于词频-逆文档频率的经典方法，精确匹配关键词，不需要 GPU：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>BM25</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>IDF</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{BM25}(q, d) = \\sum_{t \\in q} \\text{IDF}(t) \\cdot \\frac{f(t, d) \\cdot (k_1 + 1)}{f(t, d) + k_1 \\cdot (1 - b + b \\cdot \\frac{|d|}{avgdl})}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BM25</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4361em;vertical-align:-1.3861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IDF</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8081em;vertical-align:-1.3811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.01em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.24em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.01em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.687em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.01em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>稠密检索</strong>：将查询和文档编码为稠密向量，通过向量相似度匹配语义：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>Enc</mtext><mi>q</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>Enc</mtext><mi>d</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}(q, d) = \\text{Enc}_q(q)^T \\cdot \\text{Enc}_d(d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1774em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Enc</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Enc</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>混合检索（2026 年标准实践）</strong>：结合稀疏和稠密检索的互补优势：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>score</mtext><mtext>hybrid</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>BM25</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>Dense</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}_{\\text{hybrid}} = \\alpha \\cdot \\text{BM25}(q, d) + (1 - \\alpha) \\cdot \\text{Dense}(q, d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hybrid</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BM25</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Dense</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>BGE-M3 等 2026 年的嵌入模型原生支持多粒度检索（token 级、句子级、段落级）和跨语言对齐，使混合检索的实现更加简洁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分块策略的工程权衡\">分块策略的工程权衡</h2><p>如何将长文档切分为适合检索的片段（Chunk）直接影响 RAG 质量。核心权衡是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>太小的 chunk</strong>（&lt; 200 tokens）：语义完整性差，可能丢失必要上下文</li>\n<li><strong>太大的 chunk</strong>（&gt; 1000 tokens）：噪声增多，检索精度下降，消耗上下文窗口</li>\n</ul>\n<p>2025-2026 年的最佳实践是<strong>层级分块</strong>（Hierarchical Chunking）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>父级</strong>：按文档结构（标题、章节）自然切分，保留完整语义单元</li>\n<li><strong>子级</strong>：在父级内按句子或段落进一步切分，用于精确检索</li>\n<li><strong>检索时</strong>：匹配子级 chunk，返回时展开到父级 chunk，确保上下文完整</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 层级分块的概念实现&#10;def hierarchical_chunk(doc, parent_size=1000, child_size=200):&#10;    parents = split_by_structure(doc, max_tokens=parent_size)&#10;    chunks = []&#10;    for parent in parents:&#10;        children = split_by_sentence(parent, max_tokens=child_size)&#10;        for child in children:&#10;            chunks.append({&#10;                &quot;text&quot;: child,&#10;                &quot;parent_text&quot;: parent,  # 检索命中时返回父级&#10;                &quot;metadata&quot;: parent.metadata&#10;            })&#10;    return chunks\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 层级分块的概念实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> hierarchical_chunk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(doc, parent_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, child_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    parents </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> split_by_structure(doc, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max_tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">parent_size)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    chunks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parents:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        children </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> split_by_sentence(parent, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max_tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">child_size)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> child </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> children:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            chunks.append({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                \"text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: child,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                \"parent_text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: parent,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 检索命中时返回父级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                \"metadata\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: parent.metadata</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chunks</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"高级-rag-模式\">高级 RAG 模式</h2><p><strong>Multi-Query RAG</strong>：将用户查询改写为多个视角的子查询，分别检索后合并去重：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>docs</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>dedupe</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><munderover><mo>⋃</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><mtext>Retrieve</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>Rewrite</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{docs} = \\text{dedupe}\\left(\\bigcup_{i=1}^{k} \\text{Retrieve}(\\text{Rewrite}_i(q))\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">docs</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dedupe</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">⋃</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Retrieve</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Rewrite</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这解决了单一查询表达不完整的问题——用户的真实信息需求往往无法用一句话精确表达。</p>\n<p><strong>Self-RAG</strong>：模型在生成过程中自主决定是否需要检索、检索什么、如何使用检索结果。通过特殊 token（如 <code>[Retrieve]</code>、<code>[IsRel]</code>、<code>[IsSup]</code>）实现细粒度的检索-生成交互控制。</p>\n<p><strong>GraphRAG</strong>：利用知识图谱捕获实体间关系，在向量检索的基础上沿图结构扩展检索范围。对于需要多跳推理的查询（&quot;A 公司 CEO 的母校在哪个城市？&quot;），GraphRAG 显著优于纯向量检索。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rag-vs-长上下文-vs-微调-何时用什么\">RAG vs 长上下文 vs 微调：何时用什么</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RAG</td>\n<td>知识库频繁更新、需要引用溯源</td>\n<td>实时性、可解释、成本低</td>\n<td>检索质量依赖分块与嵌入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长上下文</td>\n<td>单文档深度分析、代码库理解</td>\n<td>无信息损失、端到端简洁</td>\n<td>成本高（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）、受窗口限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微调</td>\n<td>风格/格式/流程固化</td>\n<td>推理时无额外延迟</td>\n<td>知识时效性差、成本高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RAG + 长上下文</td>\n<td>企业级问答系统</td>\n<td>兼顾广度与深度</td>\n<td>工程复杂度最高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2026 年的趋势是三者融合——检索提供候选文档、长上下文模型深度理解文档内容、微调固化交互格式与领域风格。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>RAG 是解决 LLM 幻觉和知识时效性的生产级方案</li>\n<li>混合检索（BM25 + 稠密）配合重排序是 2026 年的标准检索管线</li>\n<li>分块策略直接影响下游质量，层级分块是当前最佳实践</li>\n<li>RAG、长上下文、微调三者不互斥，应根据场景组合使用</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章下一篇 <a href=\"multimodal-transformers\">多模态 Transformer</a>展示 RAG 如何扩展到图像、视频等多模态检索</li>\n<li>预训练篇 <a href=\"../pretraining/pretraining-objectives\">预训练目标</a>中对比学习训练的嵌入模型是 RAG 检索器的基座</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../llm-fine-tuning/methods/lora-qlora\">LLM 微调中的 LoRA</a>可用于微调 RAG 系统中的生成器与重排序器</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"检索增强生成：让模型接入外部知识","id":"检索增强生成-让模型接入外部知识"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"检索器设计：从稀疏到稠密再到混合","id":"检索器设计-从稀疏到稠密再到混合"},{"level":2,"text":"分块策略的工程权衡","id":"分块策略的工程权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"高级 RAG 模式","id":"高级-rag-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"RAG vs 长上下文 vs 微调：何时用什么","id":"rag-vs-长上下文-vs-微调-何时用什么"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"混合专家模型：稀疏激活突破参数天花板","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/nlp-transformers/pretraining/mixture-of-experts"},"next":{"title":"多模态 Transformer：统一视觉、语言与音频的表征空间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/nlp-transformers/applications/multimodal-transformers"}}